# The catalog cannot be read at launch (503 until the `modelsup` line, past the
# launch read and before the prompt: a point in the scenario, not a moment on
# the gateway's clock, which each binary's launch reaches at a different time,
# registry #19), a turn starts once it is back, and `/model` asks again while
# it runs -- with the catalog answering eight seconds after it is asked. The
# model's question arrives while that read is on its way, and is up when it
# lands. fx's load runs on a thread of its own (`startWarmup` ->
# `preloadThreadMain`, `model_cache_runtime.zig:321-349`, `:698-743`), so the
# question does not hold it; the menu behind the question takes the rows
# (`pollLoadTransition`, `:549-557`), and they are there when the question is
# answered. The gateway log stamps when the read was asked and when it
# answered, ahead of the completion the answer sends.
models models.json
modelsdown
modelsdelay 8000
gateway model-parked-turns.json
wait 6.5
modelsup
snap start
type pick a database
key Enter
wait 1
type /model
key Enter
wait 0.6
snap menu-loading
wait 4
snap question-up
wait 5.5
snap question-landed
key 1
wait 2
snap answered
gwlog
